   "lines": [
    "My twentieth birth-",
    "day. Lovely though",
    "it is to be spendin[?]",
    "it with darling",
    "Muffie, Bysie and",
    "Pussie[?], I can",
    "not help having",
    "some very sad",
    "thoughts about",
    "my beloved Father.",
    "Oh, Father, sometimes",
    "I feel as though",
    "I would give",
    "half my life to",
    "see you but",
    "for a moment!",
    "Oh, what loving memories",
    "I have of you!"
   ],
